  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C. Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-666b728af6d6f122b49fdd37-c5020af2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-666b728af6d6f122b49fdd37-a1908cef.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 mins remaining, drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add tomato paste, remaining garlic, jerk seasoning and lentils and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the stock powder and water (for the sauce). Simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir through roasted veggies and baby spinach until wilted and combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-666b728af6d6f122b49fdd37-f56e119f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and lentils between bowls. Top with yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-666b728af6d6f122b49fdd37-7030ecf1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
